`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`
A pretzel's topology is tricky: the dough forms one continuous path that crosses itself, creating two holes. The crossing is represented here as two overlapping horizontal bars at y=9, while the inner walls (x=10, x=14) separate the left and right holes from each other.
`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`

