`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`
The two crossing bars (B 4 9... and B 12 9...) intentionally overlap at x=12–14 — this voxel overlap encodes the pretzel's self-crossing knot. In a richer renderer, the z-offset of the depth dimension (z=1 vs z=3) could be used to show one arm going over the other.
`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`
